[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_04_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_04_0010","text":"翻开题目卡，围绕该话题进行讨论\n——这次的卡片是……『恋爱话题』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_04_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_04_0020","text":"……这个，可以吗……？\n跟大家聊这些……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_04_0021","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_04_0030","text":"来投票吧……\n说实话……感兴趣的人……举手——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_04_0031","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_04_0032","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_04_0040","text":"呵呵……\n那就逃不掉了呢……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_04_0050","text":"我只听不说——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_04_0060","text":"只听不说没举手的就是雾子一个人哦——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_04_0070","text":"呵呵……\n越来越有女子会的感觉了呢……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_04_0080","text":"那……谁先讲……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_04_0090","text":"………………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30700500_04_0100","text":"石头剪刀布！剪刀石头布…………！\n诶……！？／呵呵——／嗯……！／哇……！"}]
